summary.label:
HANMA is a simple and efficient label designer with a portable resource library, supports one-click batch printing.
[Simple and Efficient]
The HANMA enables label design to achieve WYSIWYG, which can be completed by simply dragging and dropping. Label design has never been so simple and efficient;
[Application scenario]
For different industry applications, HERELABEL provides a wealth of scene-based label templates, such as address labels, text labels, barcode labels, shipping labels, retail labels, etc., and you can design your favorite labels with just one click;
[Multi-terminal data exchange]
Unified account system with high-quality cloud storage service, so that personal tags, databases and image storage are no longer limited by space;
[One-click batch printing]
Support Excel database import and serialization settings, easy to achieve label batch printing.

Clean up your device by using a unique smart cleaner. You can clean up similar photos and videos with a few taps. You do not only delete similars but can add photos and videos to Secret Albums, as well as contacts to Secret Contacts. Information in Secret Space will be securely hidden from prying eyes with Passcode Protection.

The Organize Contacts feature lets you merge duplicate contacts and fill in missing information in contacts. The Adblocker feature allows you to get rid of annoying ads.
Now, you do not have to download and install multiple apps to organize contacts and free up space on your phone.

Premium Features:
- Easy, fast, and smart cleaning;
- Clean up similar photos and videos;
- Compress Video feature to clean up more memory on your device;
- Organize Contacts;
- Secret Space for files and contacts;
- Protect your data with Passcode Protection;
- Ads blocker;

SUBSCRIPTIONS:
1-month Subscription
